{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57899","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57899","key":"SV-11405","fields":{"summary":"Board View: card status uses the List's status pill with its red and blue counts","parent":{"id":"56387","key":"SV-10043","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56387","fields":{"summary":"Work Orders — Board View & Tech View Display Options","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10004","description":"This work item is being actively worked on at the moment by the assignee.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"In Progress","id":"10004","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"Epics track collections of related bugs, stories, and tasks. (Migrated on 31 Dec 2023 09:01 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10306?size=medium","name":"Epic","subtask":false,"avatarId":10306,"entityId":"b16adb77-4b77-44c6-9be7-926745903790","hierarchyLevel":1}}},"attachment":[],"description":"h3. What\n\nA Board View card shows the same status pill as List and Tech View, with the red service-actions and blue parts-actions counts.\n\nh3. Expected\n\nS3-R5a: \"A Board View card's status is the same status pill List shows in production, with the same red service-actions count and blue parts-actions count on it, as in Tech View (S2-R19), at the design's card badge height (22px).\" The badge stays in a fixed spot on the card (S3-R5).\n\nPRD: [Board View & Tech View PRD v55|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (S3-R5a, S6-R2a).\n\nh3. Actual (origin/develop, 2026-10-15)\n\nThe card shows a plain badge with the status name only: no red or blue counts, and not the List's pill.\n\nh3. How to check\n\n* A card for a work order with pending service actions shows the red count; with pending parts actions, the blue count; with tooltips as in List.\n* The pill is 22px tall and in the same place on every card.\n* The pill reads the same as that work order's pill in List and Tech View.\n\nFrom the PRD v54/v55 rulings on Bilal's and Slavcho's questions, 2026-10-15.","reporter":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57899/comment/78807","id":"78807","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b5